  "goodToKnow": "Gemach! or Gemach, gemach! is an old-fashioned way to say easy now or slow down, today used jokingly. The related adjective gemächlich (leisurely) is common: ein gemächliches Tempo. As a noun, das Gemach is a literary word for a chamber: die königlichen Gemächer. Both come from an old word for comfort, related to gemütlich and bequem."
